      "body": "### Tested versions\n\nv4.8.dev5.official [9552dfb68]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev5 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (1920x1080 @ 120.00 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11320H @ 3.20GHz (8 threads) - 15.78 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot crashes when trying to create a new script in the script field of any resource -- standard material, pure resource, whatever.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn the script field of the inspector panel for any resource, click <empty> and select \"(new) GDScript\". Godot will crash. Dragging a script to the field or using the quick load button work fine.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32804208/bug_mrp.zip)",
